        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bruce Lee, Keye Luke\n- Characters: Kato\n- Series: The Green Hornet\n- Concepts: Jeet Kune Do\n\nFacts:\n- Kato is a fictional character in The Green Hornet series.\n- Keye Luke played Kato in The Green Hornet movie serials.\n- Bruce Lee, born Lee Jun-fan on November 27, 1940, was later known professionally as Bruce Lee.\n- Bruce Lee portrayed Kato in The Green Hornet television series.\n- Bruce Lee was a Hong Kong and American actor, film director, martial artist, martial arts instructor, philosopher, and founder of Jeet Kune Do.\n- Bruce Lee died on July 20, 1973.",
